  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "display_name": "Design a Brand Kit",
    "long_instructions": "## Design a Brand Kit\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n1. Choose a topic for your hobby website.\r\n\r\n2. Create a brand kit that captures your chosen website topic. Include:\r\n    - 3–5 color swatches\r\n    - A font pair (heading + body text)\r\n    - 1–2 descriptive style words (e.g., sleek, bold, approachable)\r\n    - 1 image that represents your hobby's world or feeling.\r\n    - (Optional) 1 logo, icon, or background texture that ties your design together.\r\n\r\n3. Add your sketch to your **Backpack** to use in the next level.\r\n",
    "bubble_choice_description": "Create your brand kit, aligning your colors, fonts, and style words to your chosen user persona.",
    "thumbnail_url": "https://images.code.org/2dc43811079ab3e241537656dbb50a36-Gemini_Generated_Image_o9w5dso9w5dso9w5.png",
