          {
            "id": "7126f50c-fd02-4217-ace7-dec382e7675b",
            "type": "shape",
            "data": {
              "shapeType": "rectangle",
              "label": "User Persona #1\n\nWho she is: Varsity winger \n+ part-time barista. Ten-\nminute passing periods are \nher whole window.\n\nHabits & prefs: Saves \nfavorite orders; lactose-\nsensitive; lives in Notes \nand Reminders; cracked \niPhone screen.\n\nNeeds: Speed, price \nclarity, and simple choices\nthat don’t derail her day.\n",
              "showHandles": false,
              "backgroundColor": "var(--sketchlab-bg-pink)"
            },
            "position": {
              "x": 979.4747487275956,
              "y": 338.4506858699613
